    {
      "id": "p_plan2_b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 596,
      "y": 2744,
      "width": 425,
      "height": 298,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "PHASE 3 \u2014 OBSERVABILITY & EVAL\n[ ] 11. LangSmith tracing: chains, agents, tools\n[ ] 12. Eval datasets + evaluators\n[ ] 13. LLM-as-judge for report quality\n\nPHASE 4 \u2014 API & STREAMING\n[ ] 14. POST /research \u2014 create + async run\n[ ] 15. GET /research/{id} \u2014 status/results\n[ ] 16. GET /research/{id}/stream \u2014 SSE\n[ ] 17. CORS, errors, timeout/retry\n\nPHASE 5 \u2014 POLISH\n[ ] 18. pytest: API, tools, orchestrator\n[ ] 19. Dockerfile + docker-compose\n[ ] 20. README + docs + examples\n[ ] 21. Frontend chat UI (optional)\n[ ] 22. Eval results + trace links in CI",
      "originalText": "PHASE 3 \u2014 OBSERVABILITY & EVAL\n[ ] 11. LangSmith tracing: chains, agents, tools\n[ ] 12. Eval datasets + evaluators\n[ ] 13. LLM-as-judge for report quality\n\nPHASE 4 \u2014 API & STREAMING\n[ ] 14. POST /research \u2014 create + async run\n[ ] 15. GET /research/{id} \u2014 status/results\n[ ] 16. GET /research/{id}/stream \u2014 SSE\n[ ] 17. CORS, errors, timeout/retry\n\nPHASE 5 \u2014 POLISH\n[ ] 18. pytest: API, tools, orchestrator\n[ ] 19. Dockerfile + docker-compose\n[ ] 20. README + docs + examples\n[ ] 21. Frontend chat UI (optional)\n[ ] 22. Eval results + trace links in CI",
