      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "# --- LLM -----------------------------------------------\nGROQ_API_KEY=<groq key>\nGROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile\n\n# --- tools ---------------------------------------------\nTAVILY_API_KEY=<tavily key>\n\n# --- database ------------------------------------------\nSUPABASE_URL=https://<project>.supabase.co\nSUPABASE_KEY=<service-role key \u2014 server only, never ship\n              this to a browser client>\n\n# --- observability -------------------------------------\nLANGSMITH_TRACING=true\nLANGSMITH_API_KEY=<langsmith key>\nLANGSMITH_PROJECT=research-agent\n\n# --- app -----------------------------------------------\nCORS_ORIGINS=[\"http://localhost:3000\"]\n\n# .env stays gitignored \u2014 commit only this example file.",
      "originalText": "# --- LLM -----------------------------------------------\nGROQ_API_KEY=<groq key>\nGROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile\n\n# --- tools ---------------------------------------------\nTAVILY_API_KEY=<tavily key>\n\n# --- database ------------------------------------------\nSUPABASE_URL=https://<project>.supabase.co\nSUPABASE_KEY=<service-role key \u2014 server only, never ship\n              this to a browser client>\n\n# --- observability -------------------------------------\nLANGSMITH_TRACING=true\nLANGSMITH_API_KEY=<langsmith key>\nLANGSMITH_PROJECT=research-agent\n\n# --- app -----------------------------------------------\nCORS_ORIGINS=[\"http://localhost:3000\"]\n\n# .env stays gitignored \u2014 commit only this example file.",
